      "content": "it's not just a \"quiet moment.\" it feels more like being a ghost in my own house. everything is so much harder than it used to be, even just getting up to make tea. i look at the calendar and i just see nothing. nothing new, nothing to look forward to. it's like the world has moved on and left me behind in this chair.",
